<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fletcher Challenge report judged best.</title>
<headline>Fletcher Challenge report judged best.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Ltd on Wednesday won the Institute of Chartered Accountants' award for the best annual report of the top 20 listed companies.</p>
<p>The New Zealand Dairy Group of Companies won the &quot;other listed companies&quot; category.</p>
<p>The Auckland Regional Council won the non-commercial public sector category and Electricity Corp of New Zealand won the commercial public sector category.</p>
<p>NZ on Air won the other entities category.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom, 64 4 4734 746</p>
